{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_C24706AD","title":"Ma Gomba 2nd Try","entry":"Dlg_C24706AD::entry","exit":"Dlg_C24706AD::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_AFB8AFBB","articyId":"72057611217836855","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"I'm surprised to see you getting so close. I had you down as a mycophobe.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm surprised to see you getting so close. I had you down as a mycophobe.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":325.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48410","byteOffset":32649656,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_316A19B4","articyId":"72057611217836890","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Why wouldn't you be? They can stop a heart, enchant a mind, even bring down a city with the right encouragement. Plus, they're simply delicious on toast. Now, have you reconsidered my offer?","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why wouldn't you be? They can stop a heart, enchant a mind, even bring down a city with the right encouragement. Plus, they're simply delicious on toast. Now, have you reconsidered my offer?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":975.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27780","byteOffset":18391816,"byteLength":536}},{"id":"DFr_6DBC1BC0","articyId":"72057611217836897","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Very wise. You might as well be afraid of the air you breathe. Have you reconsidered my offer?","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Very wise. You might as well be afraid of the air you breathe. Have you reconsidered my offer?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":974.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49013","byteOffset":32883408,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_C26DEA7B","articyId":"72057611217836924","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"I'm glad to hear it. Symbiosis is the key to success. I will send you a free sample. Use it in your kitchen. I will watch and take note of the results.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm glad to hear it. Symbiosis is the key to success. I will send you a free sample. Use it in your kitchen. I will watch and take note of the results.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1575.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38556","byteOffset":28920664,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_D6BF3C69","articyId":"72057611217836950","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Just a little biotrophic enoki I've been working on. Scrumptious in ramen.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Just a little biotrophic enoki I've been working on. Scrumptious in ramen.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37599","byteOffset":28563176,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_108BC532","articyId":"72057611217836983","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"Oh my dear, no. I want your customers to be the pigs.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh my dear, no. I want your customers to be the pigs.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42566","byteOffset":30431368,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_A23395DE","articyId":"72057611217841279","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ma Gomba","text":"I will. And so will you, since the spores are already in your lungs. Have a nice day.","speakerId":"Ntt_04E593DC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I will. And so will you, since the spores are already in your lungs. Have a nice day.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1850.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39655","byteOffset":29331488,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_E33BF47F","articyId":"72057611217836862","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm not afraid of you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not afraid of you.","TextSheVersion":"I'm not afraid of you.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm not afraid of you."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":675.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28341","byteOffset":18604152,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_59F7F2B9","articyId":"72057611217836868","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Why would I be afraid of mushrooms?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why would I be afraid of mushrooms?","TextSheVersion":"Why would I be afraid of mushrooms?","TextTheyVersion":"Why would I be afraid of mushrooms?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":675.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22040","byteOffset":16224736,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DF